<title>UK: Marks &amp; Spencer leads UK retailers higher.</title>
<headline>Marks &amp; Spencer leads UK retailers higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Marks and Spencer Plc led the UK retail sector higher on Tuesday amid a stock shortage and positive press comment, traders said.</p>
<p>Marks and Spencer shares were 11-1/2p higher at 5.00 stg by 0947 GMT.</p>
